[This is the 100 word description of the contents of the TurboPower
subdirectory.]

TurboPower Software specializes in programmer's tools for Borland compilers.
All TurboPower products are available for both Borland C++ and Borland Pascal.
A variety of TurboPower demonstration programs are provided here in the
\TPOWER directory, which contains a single self-extracting archive named
TPOWER.EXE. Run this file to obtain the various TurboPower demonstration
programs. See the READ.ME file produced in this directory for more
information.
